{"name": "Dino Path Trail", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"200\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2481670/extras/b0faeefc7a21e2457a90c43527d203d2.avif?t=1781509754\" width=\"616\"/></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>DISCOVER YOUR PATH</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Venture into a lawless frontier where survival depends on every decision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each biome - from burning deserts to haunted swamps and frozen peaks - presents unique threats and rare opportunities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sub-biomes, hidden routes, and unpredictable enemies keep every run fresh.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will you outlast the wild? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"366\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2481670/extras/d370eb3e68b19fc625817c1f469647d5.poster.avif?t=1781509754\" width=\"650\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2481670/extras/d370eb3e68b19fc625817c1f469647d5.webm?t=1781509754\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2481670/extras/d370eb3e68b19fc625817c1f469647d5.mp4?t=1781509754\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>BRING YOUR BASE CAMP WITH YOU</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You don\u2019t find safety - you build it.<br/>Grow and customize your mobile Base Camp to follow you through the frontier.<br/>Upgrade workbenches, secure resources, and expand your shelter as you push deeper into the wild.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In a world that never stops hunting you, your camp is your only constant. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\