mistake costs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Adapt, improvise - or die.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"346\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2481670/extras/d0b80def9e8d56fbee3132316d01f6a6.poster.avif?t=1781509754\" width=\"616\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2481670/extras/d0b80def9e8d56fbee3132316d01f6a6.webm?t=1781509754\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2481670/extras/d0b80def9e8d56fbee3132316d01f6a6.mp4?t=1781509754\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Are you prepared to survive?</strong></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Survive a Wild West where dinosaurs never went extinct. Fight off predators, outlaws, and the elements as you journey across deadly biomes to rescue your kidnapped sister. Hunt or be hunted in this ruthless survival roguelike.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2481670/f08391e25d52f549b239778a56c7fc0e196d9f47/header.jpg?t=1781509754", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Survival", "Action-Adventure", "Action Roguelike", "Open World Survival Craft", "Action", "Crafting"], "developers": "Void Pointer", "publishers": "Void Pointer", "release_date": "May 9, 2025", "price": "$1.42", "appid": "2481670", "review_type": "Recommended", "curator_desc": "5 February 2025 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/uGgmw6tT_9s", "first_seen": 1738710000.0, "review_rank": 1862}